586 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 130 0 R/T(Question as given: Implement a program that simulates at least three disk scheduling algorithms: FCFS, SSTF, and SCAN. The program should take as input the disk request queue, the initial head position, and the disk size. It must compute the total seek time for each algorithm, display the order in which disk requests are serviced, and compare their performance. The output should include the seek sequence and total seek time for each algorithm, along with identification of the best-performing algorithm based on minimum seek time.)/E(Question as given: Implement a program that simulates at least three disk scheduling algorithms: FCFS, SSTF, and SCAN. The program should take as input the disk request queue, the initial head position, and the disk size. It must compute the total seek time for each algorithm, display the order in which disk requests are serviced, and compare their performance. The output should include the seek sequence and total seek time for each algorithm, along with identification of the best-performing algorithm based on minimum seek time.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

